go-to: root

We accept. Money and a few arms are on their way; so are the advisers. The Right, who know the German workers better than Moscow does, are uneasy, and the Left, which has just seen its stock rise, is not.

@warn
subtitle: Trust -8, Right +4 strength. · dev: trust −8, kf_right_strength +4, kf_left_dissent +5
on-arrival: comintern_trust -= 8; kf_right_strength += 4; kf_left_dissent += 5
go-to: root

We tell the truth, which is that the SPD left is not ready to fight and our Hundreds are not armed. Moscow notes the report and the name of the man who wrote it. The Left says the leadership has lost its nerve, and the Left will remember this when it counts.
